  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">If <math alttext=\"3 x equals 30\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>30</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
