  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Subtracting <math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math> from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12 equals 30 minus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12 equals 18\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math> is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"x minus 12\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"x plus 12\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"3 x plus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"3 x minus 12\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p>",
